{"id":"662897","name":"胡萝卜玉米肉饼汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662897/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄玉胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"前腿肉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"今天用山姆的黄玉胡萝卜试一下。","img":"images/662897/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"前腿肉提前绞碎备用。","img":"images/662897/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，盐，鸡精。","img":"images/662897/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入玉米淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/662897/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"玉米洗净切块。","img":"images/662897/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮洗净切滚刀块。","img":"images/662897/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将玉米和胡萝卜放入锅中。","img":"images/662897/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水，大火煮开。","img":"images/662897/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将肉沫搓成圆球。","img":"images/662897/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"肉饼一个个放入煮开的汤里。","img":"images/662897/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上小火煲1小时左右。","img":"images/662897/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅前少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/662897/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662897/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662897/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}